  "problem_id": "Erdos 1008: Folkman obstruction and rectangular exact extremum (JSP correspondence pending)",
  "scope": "For all s,t, a C4-free subgraph of K(s,t) has at most t+choose(s,2) edges. This is attained for s>=1 and t>=choose(s,2). Full negative answer to the uniform m^(3/4) guarantee. Not a new proof of the modern m^(2/3) lower guarantee, and not a general solution of all rectangular Zarankiewicz numbers.",
